            "id": 130747,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Nesnelere bakalım. Bir nesne tanımlamaya başlamak için süslü parantezleri <code>{</code> ve <code>}</code> kullanırız. Bunu JavaScript'ten zaten biliyorsun.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"typescript\" name=\"script.ts\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" person: { };\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"12\" endIndex=\"13\" /><option startIndex=\"14\" endIndex=\"15\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"(\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\")\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>{</code>, ardından <code>}</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #5 - Copy",
            "id": 130798,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Nitelikleri, daha önce türleri tanımladığımız gibi nesnenin içinde tanımlarız. Adla başla, ardından iki nokta üst üste ve türünü yaz.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"typescript\" name=\"script.ts\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" person: {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" name: \" /><text value=\"string\" class=\"built_in\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"};\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"15\" endIndex=\"19\" /><option startIndex=\"19\" endIndex=\"20\" /><option startIndex=\"21\" endIndex=\"27\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"number\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>name</code>, ardından <code>:</code> ve son olarak <code>string</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #5 - Copy - Copy",
            "id": 130799,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Birden fazla özniteliği virgüllerle ayırırız.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"typescript\" name=\"script.ts\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" person: {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" name: \" /><text value=\"string\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\",\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" age: \" /><text value=\"number\" class=\"built_in\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"};\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"27\" endIndex=\"28\" /><option startIndex=\"30\" endIndex=\"41\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&amp;\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\";\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>,</code>, ardından <code>age: number</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #5 - Copy",
            "id": 130797,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Şimdiye kadar nesnenin türünü tanımladık. Artık bir değer atayabiliriz.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"typescript\" name=\"script.ts\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" person: {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" name: \" /><text value=\"string\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\",\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" age: \" /><text value=\"number\" class=\"built_in\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"} \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"person = {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" name: \" /><text value=\"&quot;John&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\",\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" age: \" /><text value=\"25\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"};\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(person.name, person.age);\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"53\" endIndex=\"54\" /><option startIndex=\"55\" endIndex=\"56\" /><option startIndex=\"58\" endIndex=\"71\" /><option startIndex=\"73\" endIndex=\"80\" /><option startIndex=\"81\" endIndex=\"82\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"John 25\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>=</code>, ardından <code>{</code> ve sonra <code>name: \"John\",</code>, <code>age: 25</code>, <code>}</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #6",
            "id": 130748,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Bir nesne tanımladıktan sonra, JavaScript kullanırken yaptığımız gibi onunla etkileşime girebiliriz. Örneğin, nesne özelliklerine erişebiliriz.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"typescript\" name=\"script.ts\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" person: {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" name: \" /><text value=\"string\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\",\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" age: \" /><text value=\"number\" class=\"built_in\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"};\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"person = {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" name: \" /><text value=\"&quot;John&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\",\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" age: \" /><text value=\"25\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"};\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" personName: \" /><text value=\"string\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\" = person.name;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(personName);\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"116\" endIndex=\"117\" /><option startIndex=\"117\" endIndex=\"121\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&quot;John&quot;\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"John\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>.</code>, ardından <code>name</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #7",
            "id": 130749,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Benzer şekilde, nesne özelliklerini de değiştirebilirsin. <code>person</code> nesnesinin <code>name</code> özelliğini \"Jane\" olarak değiştirmeyi dene.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"typescript\" name=\"script.ts\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" person: {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" name: \" /><text value=\"string\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\",\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" age: \" /><text value=\"number\" class=\"built_in\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"};\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"person = {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" name: \" /><text value=\"&quot;John&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\",\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" age: \" /><text value=\"25\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"};\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"person.name = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Jane&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(person.name);\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"85\" endIndex=\"91\" /><option startIndex=\"91\" endIndex=\"92\" /><option startIndex=\"92\" endIndex=\"96\" /><option startIndex=\"97\" endIndex=\"98\" /><option startIndex=\"99\" endIndex=\"105\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\".\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"==\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Jane\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>person</code>, ardından <code>.</code> ve sonra <code>name</code>, <code>=</code>, <code>\"Jane\"</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>"
          },
