            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Bir nesnenin içinde daha karmaşık türler de olabilir. Bir sayı dizisi ekleyelim.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"typescript\" name=\"script.ts\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" player: {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" name: \" /><text value=\"string\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\",\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" scores: \" /><text value=\"number\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\"[]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"38\" endIndex=\"44\" /><option startIndex=\"44\" endIndex=\"46\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"string\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>number</code>, ardından <code>[]</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>"
