            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Elbette, nesnelerde bir değeri doğrudan da atayabiliriz.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"typescript\" name=\"script.ts\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" player: {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" name: \" /><text value=\"string\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\",\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" scores: \" /><text value=\"number\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\"[]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"} = {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" name: \" /><text value=\"&quot;Lee&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\",\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" scores: [\" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"2\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"3\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"};\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(player.scores);\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"49\" endIndex=\"50\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"is\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"[1, 2, 3]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>=</code> öğesini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>"
